Battle of the Year is a 2013 American dance film directed by Benson Lee.

11
01:11:10,588 --> 01:11:16,588
The film stars Josh Holloway, Chris Brown, Laz
Alonso, Caity Lotz, and Josh Peck.

12
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
It is based upon Lee's award-winning 2007 documentary Planet B-Boy,
about the b-boying competition Battle of the Year.

13
01:24:07,058 --> 01:24:13,058
The feature film includes cinematography by Vasco Nunes, Lee's
director of photography on the original documentary.

14
01:30:35,294 --> 01:30:41,294
The film was released theatrically on September 20,
2013 by Sony Pictures Releasing.

15
01:37:03,529 --> 01:37:09,529
It received negative reviews from critics, and grossed
$16 million against a budget of $20M.

